<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <!-- Default Title (updated dynamically) -->
  <title>FUNAI Accommodation & Transportation Guide</title>

  <!-- Dynamic Year-Based Title -->
  <script>
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {
      const year = new Date().getFullYear();
      const nextYear = year + 1;
      document.title = `AE-FUNAI ${year}/${nextYear} Accommodation & Transportation Guide`;
    });
  </script>

  <!-- SEO Meta Tags -->
  <meta name="description" content="Learn about AE-FUNAI accommodation options for students, transportation services from nearby airports, shuttles, and campus navigation.">
  <meta name="keywords" content="FUNAI, AE-FUNAI, FUNAI accommodation, AE-FUNAI transport, campus shuttle, travel to FUNAI, how to reach FUNAI, student accommodation, airport to FUNAI">
  <meta name="author" content="AE-FUNAI Admission Portal">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://mysearch-query.onrender.com/funai-accommodation-transport">

  <!-- Open Graph -->
  <meta property="og:title" content="AE-FUNAI Accommodation & Transportation Guide">
  <meta property="og:description" content="All you need to know about student housing and transportation services at AE-FUNAI.">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://mysearch-query.onrender.com/funai-accommodation-transport">
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://mysearch-query.onrender.com/images/funai-campus.jpg">

  <!-- Favicon -->
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">

  <!-- include header file -->
  <%- include('../includeFolder/_headers.ejs') %>
  <!-- include header file -->
</head>
<body>

  <header class="heading-top">
    <h1>AE-FUNAI Accommodation & Transportation Guide</h1>
    <p>Essential guidance on housing, campus transit, and travelling to AE-FUNAI.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="container my-5">
    <!-- General Queries Section -->
     <%- include('../includeFolder/_jamb_2.ejs') %>
    <!-- General Queries Section -->

    <main class="section-txt my-4">
      <h2 id="accommodation">1. FUNAI Accommodation for International Students</h2>
      <p>International students at FUNAI can apply for on-campus accommodation, although spaces are limited. It is advisable to apply early to secure a spot in the hostel.</p>

      <h2 id="travel">2. How to Travel to FUNAI Campus from the Airport?</h2>
      <p>The nearest airport to FUNAI is Aba Airport, which is about 1.5 hours away from the campus. Students can take a taxi or arrange transportation via the university’s transport office.</p>

      <h2 id="transport">3. Transport Options Around FUNAI</h2>
      <p>FUNAI is well-connected with local transport services, including buses, taxis, and shuttles. Students can also use the campus transport services for commuting within the city.</p>

      <h2 id="shuttles">4. Are There Shuttles to Campus from Nearby Towns?</h2>
      <p>Yes, FUNAI provides shuttle services from surrounding towns like Abakaliki to the campus. Check the shuttle schedule on the university’s transport page.</p>
    </main>
  </div>

  <!-- hot links...........................///////////// -->
  <%- include('../includeFolder/hot_link_1.ejs') %>
  <%- include('../includeFolder/hot_link_2.ejs') %>
  <!-- hot links...........................///////////// -->

  <script>
    document.querySelectorAll('nav ul li a').forEach(link => {
      link.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        const targetId = this.getAttribute('href').substring(1);
        const targetSection = document.getElementById(targetId);

        if (targetSection) {
          window.scrollTo({
            top: targetSection.offsetTop - 50,
            behavior: 'smooth'
          });
        }
      });
    });
  </script>

  <!-- footer ......................................... -->
  <script src="js/index.js"></script>
  <%- include('../includeFolder/_footer.ejs') %>
  <!-- footer ......................................... -->
</body>
</html>